~ start
Narrator: You wake up and cannot feel your limbs [#art=black]
Narrator: You lie still in an attempt to ground yourself
You: *silence*
Narrator: It seems as though you're unable to talk
You: *meow*
Narrator: Oh? How interesting. Open your second eyelids, and look behind you.
[next=1.5] [#art=catlookdownfade]
Narrator: You successfully force your eyes open and suddenly, you can see! [#art=catlookdown]
You: *meow*
Narrator: As for why you're unable to speak, the answer lies behind you...
Narrator: You slowly turn your head backwards. Your neck feels far more flexible than it should be. [#art=lookingatwall]
Narrator: You see a cat before you. [#art=kittymirror]
=> END